=============================Bitcoin Volatility Analysis Using ARIMA-GARCH=====================================
This project analyzes Bitcoin (BTC-USD) historical data using financial time series and econometric techniques.

The analysis combines:
 * ARIMA (AutoRegressive Integrated Moving Average)
 * GARCH (Generalized AutoRegressive Conditional Heteroskedasticity)
 to model return dynamics and volatility behavior in financial markets.

The project demonstrates a complete workflow including:
 * Data collection from Yahoo Finance
 * Log return calculation
 * Stationarity testing (ADF)
 * ACF & PACF analysis
 * ARIMA modeling
 * GARCH volatility modeling
 * Forecasting future return and volatility

Detailed Analysis
 A complete statistical and financial interpretation of the results is available in:
 **reports/analysis_report.md**

